## 4. What I verified vs what is transcribed-from-code

- Verified live: REST gated → 404s; MCP initialize + tools/list counts; `/up` 200;
  token env vars SET (values not exposed); auth logic (base_controller source).
- Transcribed from source (accurate, not yet exercised because the gate is off):
  every §1 input/output row. When the gate is flipped, the roadmap's AUT-03 re-run
  plus a read-only sweep of each §1 group confirms them end-to-end.
